---
import '@planilla/theme/tokens.css';
import '@planilla/theme/base.css';

const appUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL ?? 'http://localhost:4321';
---

<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>PlanillaInteligente — Subí tu Excel. Obtené tu app.</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Transformá las planillas que ya usás en una aplicación web estructurada, multiusuario y lista para operar."
    />
    <style>
      body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 85% 12%, #e7f3ee 0%, transparent 58%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 8% 90%, #f3ebe0 0%, transparent 55%),
          var(--paper);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .hero .cta {
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      main {
        flex: 1;
        width: min(68rem, 100%);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3.5rem;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2.75rem;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: min(72vh, 40rem);
      }

      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(20rem, 1.1fr);
          gap: 3.5rem;
        }
      }

      .lede {
        margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
        max-width: 34rem;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .scene {
        position: relative;
        isolation: isolate;
        min-height: 22rem;
      }

      .sheet,
      .app-frame {
        font-family: var(--sans);
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        box-shadow: 0 22px 50px -28px rgb(28 25 23 / 0.45);
      }

      .sheet {
        width: min(100%, 26.5rem);
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: rotate(-3.5deg);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .sheet-bar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.45rem;
        padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;
        background: var(--sheet);
        color: white;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .sheet-dot {
        width: 0.45rem;
        height: 0.45rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55);
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1.05fr 0.9fr;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
      }

      .grid span {
        padding: 0.48rem 0.55rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eef2ee;
        border-right: 1px solid #eef2ee;
        color: #3f3c38;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }

      .grid span:nth-child(3n) {
        border-right: 0;
      }

      .grid .h {
        background: #f3f7f4;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1f3d2c;
      }

      .app-frame {
        width: min(100%, 27rem);
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-top: -4.5rem;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: rotate(2.8deg);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .app-bar {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem 0.55rem;
        background: var(--paper);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .tab {
        padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 650;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .tab.on {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .views {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 11.2rem;
      }

      .view {
        padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem 0.9rem;
      }

      .view-kanban {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        opacity: 0;
      }

      .app-row,
      .kanban-col {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.35rem;
      }

      .app-row {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(6.2rem, 1fr) minmax(4.2rem, 0.7fr);
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0.42rem 0.2rem;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #f1ece4;
      }

      .app-row.head {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 650;
        font-size: 0.64rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        border-bottom-color: var(--line);
      }

      .pill {
        justify-self: start;
        padding: 0.12rem 0.45rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .pill.ok {
        background: #ecfccb;
        color: var(--ok);
      }

      .pill.mid {
        background: #ffedd5;
        color: var(--warn);
      }

      .pill.wait {
        background: #e7e5e4;
        color: #44403c;
      }

      .kanban {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0.45rem;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .kanban-col {
        background: #f7f3ec;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 0.45rem;
        min-height: 9.4rem;
      }

      .kanban-col strong {
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .kanban .card {
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .kanban .card small {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .steps {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 3.5rem;
      }

      @media (min-width: 720px) {
        .steps {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
          gap: 1.25rem;
        }
      }

      .step {
        padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55);
      }

      .step svg {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      }

      .step h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .step p {
        margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .site-footer {
        width: min(68rem, calc(100% - 2.5rem));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 0 2.5rem;
      }

      .disclosure {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      details:not([open]) > *:not(summary) {
        display: none;
      }

      .disclosure > summary {
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 1rem 0;
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .disclosure > summary::marker,
      .disclosure > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        content: none;
        display: none;
      }

      .disclosure-label,
      .topic-label {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .disclosure-label::after {
        content: "";
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 0.45rem;
        height: 0.45rem;
        border-right: 1.5px solid currentColor;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        translate: 0 -0.12rem;
      }

      .disclosure[open] > summary {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .disclosure[open] .disclosure-label::after {
        transform: rotate(225deg);
        translate: 0 0.12rem;
      }

      .disclosure > summary:hover {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .disclosure > summary:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--ink);
        outline-offset: 4px;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .disclosure-panel {
        padding: 0 0 1.25rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.35rem;
      }

      .disclosure-panel p {
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .topic {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .topic > summary {
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 0.85rem 0;
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .topic > summary::marker,
      .topic > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        content: none;
        display: none;
      }

      .topic-label::after {
        content: "+";
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .topic[open] .topic-label::after {
        content: "–";
      }

      .topic > summary:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--ink);
        outline-offset: 4px;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .topic p {
        margin: 0 0 0.95rem;
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        .scene,
        .step {
          animation: rise 0.7s ease both;
        }

        .scene {
          animation-delay: 0.12s;
        }

        .step:nth-child(1) {
          animation-delay: 0.18s;
        }

        .step:nth-child(2) {
          animation-delay: 0.28s;
        }

        .step:nth-child(3) {
          animation-delay: 0.38s;
        }

        .sheet {
          animation: float-sheet 7s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .app-frame {
          animation: float-app 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .grid span:not(.h) {
          animation: ink 2.8s ease both;
        }

        .grid span:nth-child(4) {
          animation-delay: 0.15s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(5) {
          animation-delay: 0.22s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(6) {
          animation-delay: 0.28s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(7) {
          animation-delay: 0.34s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(8) {
          animation-delay: 0.4s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(9) {
          animation-delay: 0.46s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(10) {
          animation-delay: 0.52s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(11) {
          animation-delay: 0.58s;
        }
        .grid span:nth-child(12) {
          animation-delay: 0.64s;
        }

        .tab-table {
          animation: tab-table 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .tab-kanban {
          animation: tab-kanban 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .view-table {
          animation: show-table 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .view-kanban {
          animation: show-kanban 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .disclosure-label::after {
          transition: transform 0.15s ease, translate 0.15s ease;
        }
      }

      @keyframes rise {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(14px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: none;
        }
      }

      @keyframes float-sheet {
        0%,
        100% {
          transform: rotate(-3.5deg) translateY(0);
        }
        50% {
          transform: rotate(-3.5deg) translateY(-8px);
        }
      }

      @keyframes float-app {
        0%,
        100% {
          transform: rotate(2.8deg) translateY(0);
        }
        50% {
          transform: rotate(2.8deg) translateY(-8px);
        }
      }

      @keyframes ink {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
        }
      }

      @keyframes show-table {
        0%,
        42%,
        100% {
          opacity: 1;
        }
        50%,
        92% {
          opacity: 0;
        }
      }

      @keyframes show-kanban {
        0%,
        42%,
        100% {
          opacity: 0;
        }
        50%,
        92% {
          opacity: 1;
        }
      }

      @keyframes tab-table {
        0%,
        42%,
        100% {
          background: var(--accent-soft);
          color: var(--accent);
        }
        50%,
        92% {
          background: transparent;
          color: var(--muted);
        }
      }

      @keyframes tab-kanban {
        0%,
        42%,
        100% {
          background: transparent;
          color: var(--muted);
        }
        50%,
        92% {
          background: var(--accent-soft);
          color: var(--accent);
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">PlanillaInteligente</p>
          <h1>Subí tu Excel. Obtené tu app.</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            Convertí las planillas que ya usa tu negocio en una aplicación web
            estructurada, multiusuario y lista para operar.
          </p>
          <a class="cta" href={appUrl}>Crear mi app</a>
        </div>

        <div class="scene" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sheet">
            <div class="sheet-bar">
              <span class="sheet-dot"></span>
              ventas.xlsx
            </div>
            <div class="grid">
              <span class="h">Cliente</span>
              <span class="h">Estado</span>
              <span class="h">Monto</span>
              <span>Acme Sur</span>
              <span>En curso</span>
              <span>$12.400</span>
              <span>Norte SA</span>
              <span>Listo</span>
              <span>$8.200</span>
              <span>Costa Ltda</span>
              <span>Pendiente</span>
              <span>$4.150</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="app-frame">
            <div class="app-bar">
              <span class="tab tab-table on">Tabla</span>
              <span class="tab tab-kanban">Kanban</span>
            </div>
            <div class="views">
              <div class="view view-table">
                <div class="app-row head">
                  <span>Cliente</span>
                  <span>Estado</span>
                  <span>Monto</span>
                </div>
                <div class="app-row">
                  <span>Acme Sur</span>
                  <span class="pill mid">En curso</span>
                  <span>$12.400</span>
                </div>
                <div class="app-row">
                  <span>Norte SA</span>
                  <span class="pill ok">Listo</span>
                  <span>$8.200</span>
                </div>
                <div class="app-row">
                  <span>Costa Ltda</span>
                  <span class="pill wait">Pendiente</span>
                  <span>$4.150</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="view view-kanban">
                <div class="kanban">
                  <div class="kanban-col">
                    <strong>Pendiente</strong>
                    <div class="card">Costa Ltda<small>$4.150</small></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="kanban-col">
                    <strong>En curso</strong>
                    <div class="card">Acme Sur<small>$12.400</small></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="kanban-col">
                    <strong>Listo</strong>
                    <div class="card">Norte SA<small>$8.200</small></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="steps" aria-label="Qué incluye">
        <article class="step">
          <h2>Equipo</h2>
          <p>Invitás a quien carga y edita la misma lista. El dueño administra la cuenta.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <h2>Resumen</h2>
          <p>Conteos y sumas salen de las columnas numéricas, sin armar un tablero a mano.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <h2>Instrucciones</h2>
          <p>Pedís un campo o una lista nueva. Ves el cambio y lo confirmás antes de aplicarlo.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="steps" aria-label="Qué no es">
        <article class="step">
          <h2>No es un ERP</h2>
          <p>No reemplaza contabilidad, facturación legal ni un editor de planillas.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <h2>Tus celdas</h2>
          <p>Por defecto el modelo no recibe el contenido. Los datos quedan en la Unión Europea.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="steps" aria-label="Cómo funciona">
        <article class="step">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="6" y="8" width="28" height="24" rx="4" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
            <path d="M6 14h28" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
            <path d="M16 8v6" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
            <path d="M13 22h14" stroke="var(--accent-soft)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
            <path d="M13 27h9" stroke="var(--accent-soft)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          </svg>
          <h2>Subí el Excel</h2>
          <p>El archivo que ya usan. Sin armar nada de cero.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="12" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
            <path d="M14 21.5 18 25l8-10" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
          <h2>Leemos la estructura</h2>
          <p>Columnas, estados y números: de ahí sale la interfaz.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="7" y="10" width="12" height="20" rx="3" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
            <rect x="21" y="10" width="12" height="12" rx="3" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
            <rect x="21" y="24" width="12" height="6" rx="2" fill="var(--accent-soft)"></rect>
          </svg>
          <h2>Operá en la app</h2>
          <p>Tabla o kanban, con tu equipo, sobre los mismos datos.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <details class="disclosure">
        <summary><span class="disclosure-label">Privacidad y seguridad</span></summary>
        <div class="disclosure-panel">
          <p>Pensado para Uruguay y su ley de protección de datos.</p>

          <details class="topic" name="compliance">
            <summary><span class="topic-label">Dónde se guardan los datos</span></summary>
            <p>
              Tus archivos quedan en la Unión Europea, un destino que Uruguay
              reconoce como adecuado. No hay un centro de datos en el país: lo que
              se guarda de forma permanente está en Europa.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="topic" name="compliance">
            <summary><span class="topic-label">Quién puede ver tus planillas</span></summary>
            <p>
              Cada negocio ve solo las suyas. Entrá con tu cuenta de Google: otra
              organización no puede acceder a tus planillas.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="topic" name="compliance">
            <summary><span class="topic-label">Qué usa la inteligencia artificial</span></summary>
            <p>
              Para armar la app miramos cómo está organizada la planilla, no el
              contenido de las celdas. Eso solo se envía si lo activás vos en esa
              planilla.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="topic" name="compliance">
            <summary><span class="topic-label">Cómo borrar tus datos</span></summary>
            <p>
              Podés borrar una planilla cuando quieras. Si das de baja el
              workspace, los datos se eliminan a los 30 días. Si pedís borrar la
              cuenta, se borra de inmediato.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </details>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
